        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dy4 cluster 1 is an SMM with two independent relaxation processes attributed to the two distinct Dy coordination sites (8- and 9-coordinate). χMT at 300 K is 56.3 cm3 mol−1 K. Under 1 kOe dc field, χM″ maxima at 1450 Hz occur at 5.7 and 12.8 K. Arrhenius fits give Δ/kB = 26.3 K, τ0 = 1.3×10−6 s (LT) and Δ/kB = 62.6 K, τ0 = 8.7×10−7 s (HT).",
